                at 2026-10-05T16:49:50.241482Z
                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                kind @decision
                text "Operator decisions 2026-10-05: build our own Rust implementation of CLDR LDML Keyboard 3.0 (UTS #35 Part 7, stable since CLDR 45) as the cross-platform keyboard engine; keyboard semantics follow macOS where targets disagree (unmatched dead key -> standalone output + key; Caps+Shift+letter uppercase; no output normalization; backspace with a pending dead key cancels only it); YAML evolves into an LDML-shaped v4 authoring format compiled to one normalized model with lossless LDML import/export (gap analysis option C+, scratchpad ldml-gap-analysis.md). WBS shape approved by the operator."
            }
